# Personal WhatsApp voice-note audio used as a real-corpus test fixture for
# Spanish transcription (see tests/fixtures/audio/README.md, which IS tracked).
# The audio itself must never be committed — it's real household audio, not
# synthetic — so ignore everything in the dir except the README.
tests/fixtures/audio/*
!tests/fixtures/audio/README.md

# Claude Code local settings and other agents' nested git worktrees live here
# (e.g. .claude/worktrees/<agent-id>/, itself a separate .git checkout).
# Nothing under .claude/ is currently tracked in this repo; ignore it so it's
# never accidentally staged — that would commit a nested worktree, not just
# local config.
.claude/
